#Objectives

1. To implement a singly linked list using C++.
2. To store contact information dynamically.
3. To add, display, search, update, and delete contacts.
4. To sort contacts alphabetically by name.
5. To prevent duplicate phone numbers.
6. To mark important contacts as emergency contacts.
7. To count the total number of contacts.
8. To understand dynamic memory allocation and linked-list operations
